Dobby and a flower and a piggy and a cow.

00:46:44.140 --> 00:46:44.560
Get on the leg.

00:46:45.630 --> 00:46:46.650
We got you now.

00:46:50.480 --> 00:46:50.880
Funny.

00:47:16.120 --> 00:47:16.680
What did I say to you?

00:47:33.200 --> 00:47:45.040
I'm sorry you lost your revenge because of me.

00:47:45.520 --> 00:47:47.480
But you should have a public apology for Zeta.

00:47:48.620 --> 00:47:50.700
Oh, getting you is enough for me.

00:47:51.260 --> 00:47:54.760
But don't you think your friends will be angry when they see those publicity pictures?

00:47:55.060 --> 00:47:56.180
Oh, they'll understand.

00:48:02.876 --> 00:48:04.196
Boy, how do you like that, huh?

00:48:04.988 --> 00:48:05.788
It's horrific.

00:48:06.748 --> 00:48:07.748
Gee!
